<h3>Main form</h3>
<h4>Menu</h4>
<p>
    Click on the navigation menu and submenu items to open a page.
</p>

<h4>Header</h4>
<p>
    Click on the button showing the full name of the logged user to
    <ul>
        <li>Change PIN (see <a href="#" class="Help" data-paragraph="PIN">PIN POPUP</a> below),</li>
        <li>Logout.</li>
    </ul>
</p>
<p>
    Click on the button <strong>Signers</strong> to
    <ul>
        <li>Change PIN of a logged signer (see <a href="#" class="Help" data-paragraph="PIN">PIN POPUP</a> below),</li>
        <li>Log a signer out,</li>
        <li>Add a signer.</li>
    </ul>
</p>

<h4>Footer</h4>
<p>
    The footer show
    <ul>
        <li>the Company name,</li>
        <li>the server date and time in UTC ,</li>
        <li>the server date and time in the company time zone,</li>
        <li>the application version.</li>
    </ul>
</p>

<h4 id="PIN">PIN POPUP</h4>
<p>
    Type and confirm your numeric <strong>PIN</strong> (at least 6 characters). Confirm your identity with your password and click to <strong>SET PIN</strong> to update the PIN.
</p>